00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:57.680
their people are dying than others.
Speaker 2: I mean, after all,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.680 --> 00:04:00.400
it's all humans, right? Maybe they
Speaker 1: care. Maybe they don't want, I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:06.640
don't know. Politically, this will&nbsp;
mean fewer Republicans around and alive&nbsp;&nbsp;

