00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:21.520
Republicans will still have voter suppression.&nbsp;
They'll have, you know, trying to use the courts,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:24.960
all these different things that we've&nbsp;
seen them now try to do, but there will&nbsp;&nbsp;

