be disproportionately fewer of them. Could it&nbsp;
affect close races? It's still really not clear.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:36.320
You know, we ran the numbers. I'm going from&nbsp;
memory now, but we ran the numbers. Looking at Ron&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:42.240
DeSantis last gubernatorial win in Florida, he's&nbsp;
the very Trumpian Republican governor of Florida.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.360 --> 00:04:50.560
I I hope I'm getting this right. I think DeSantis&nbsp;
won by about 30 something thousand votes. And when&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:59.280
we looked at the deaths in Florida and started to&nbsp;
